<p>Spain has closed its airspace to U.S. military aircraft involved in the war on Iran, widening an earlier refusal to let the U.S. use the jointly operated Rota naval base and Morón air base in Andalusia. Spanish officials said the restriction applies to aircraft linked to the conflict, not to all U.S. military flights. The move removes a western Mediterranean overflight and staging option for U.S. operations tied to the conflict.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/O4CEwOJvKlL3tneW1TLej1ng9fixf2Tc6sjdTkaB_KDy52dHpsJPCSG59hw1mucJkouGmIRUjOZT2JTcHuzz8VyvyK9L-ay0FDLXjJpPzXl7LvJMrXqwcu2rV4zQAjf3WCZ-BQ95_P_thxsHmPTRC39g5niKZXnlvECqh03pczwrKf54ro11SEFCX2WyuDBAvITPbsZiQyJqJQeJ7SlluFesFYxyY8cRGH6p-Q6gh4lYd1imehgrjYoDiWpjKSajOhZ_gDyexfu4' alt='Protest scene in Spain tied to the Iran crisis and Madrid&#x27;s opposition to the war' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Transit geography: Spain sits on the Atlantic-Mediterranean gateway, so losing access matters not just for land bases but for a broader west-to-east route into the region.</li><li>Escalation of restrictions: By moving from denying base use to denying overflight, Madrid has extended the dispute from fixed installations to Spanish sovereign airspace.</li><li>Legal justification: Spain&#x27;s defence minister called the war &quot;profoundly illegal and unjust,&quot; making opposition to the campaign&#x27;s legality central to the government&#x27;s public case.</li></ul><blockquote>profoundly illegal and unjust - Spain&#x27;s defence minister</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Spanish government: By limiting the measure to Iran-related missions, Madrid is signaling opposition to this campaign without severing all day-to-day military coordination with the United States. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/spain-closes-airspace-to-u-s-planes-involved-in-iran-war'>PBS NewsHour</a>, <a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cwy368j1e3lo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Pedro Sánchez government: PBS portrayed Madrid as Europe&#x27;s most critical voice against U.S. and Israeli military actions in the Middle East, suggesting the decision also reflects a broader foreign-policy stance. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/spain-closes-airspace-to-u-s-planes-involved-in-iran-war'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1s7txua/white_house_responds_to_spain_closing_airspace_to/'>White House responds to Spain closing airspace to US military</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/636779-spain-us-warplanes-iran/'>NATO member closes airspace to US warplanes involved in Iran war</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/spain-closes-airspace-to-u-s-planes-involved-in-iran-war'>Spain closes airspace to U.S. planes involved in Iran war</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cwy368j1e3lo'>Spain closes airspace to US aircraft involved in Iran war</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/3/31/spain-closes-airspace-to-us-warplanes-involved-in-war-on-iran'>Spain closes airspace to US warplanes involved in war on Iran</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/spain-denies-us-permission-to-use-its-airspace-for-illegal-war-on-iran/article70804194.ece'>Spain denies U.S. permission to use its airspace for ‘illegal’ war on Iran</a> - thehindu.com</li></ul>